	"FriendlyName": "Folio",
	"Description": "HTML/CSS-style UI for Unreal Engine 5. Build using markup, without unreal engine dependency. Text and vector art stays sharp at any size or DPI. Avoid TAA/TSR blurring and motion blur for crisp in-world UI. Project UI onto surfaces. Spatial navigation.",
